stb_image.h v2.34 and stb_image_write.h v1.18 by Sean Barrett (http://nothings.org/stb),
vendored unmodified. Used by the custom texture pack loader (port/runtime/gx/texture_pack.cpp)
to decode replacement PNGs and to write dumped textures.

Both files are taken from https://github.com/nothings/stb at commit
1da9ade1e66195252114f5da497f244704a6c58d (2026-11-19, "bump stb_image version number"), the
commit that sets stb_image.h to v2.34. Git blob ids: stb_image.h
9e65b834cfd7e34d9f8f8bd81d1c5e6eae128fc7, stb_image_write.h
aa1d629ba37316e4b9d07c8c096ab5cfc3c4cecd.

